  "Emma and Ali plant seeds in two brown pots.": "/audio/basic-english/91ebb704f635726df6fe.m4a",
  "Emma plants beans.": "/audio/basic-english/397ae4ffd0baf03fd778.m4a",
  "Ali plants peas.": "/audio/basic-english/152a89b5d4fbda20c034.m4a",
  "The pots look the same, so each child makes a label.": "/audio/basic-english/13dbf59100ca33d6369b.m4a",
  "Emma writes \"BEANS\" and draws a sun.": "/audio/basic-english/386961d500696a412ae2.m4a",
  "Ali writes \"PEAS\" and draws a star.": "/audio/basic-english/16a21f88b1717d84fbf0.m4a",
  "They put the labels beside their pots.": "/audio/basic-english/1902306521407490d564.m4a",
  "A week later, small green leaves appear.": "/audio/basic-english/8d1e2d5de69ad9b95dc1.m4a",
  "Emma wants to take her bean plant home.": "/audio/basic-english/10d26f2026b6836e6abd.m4a",
  "She looks at the leaves but is not sure which pot is hers.": "/audio/basic-english/64d07a96377a8126a7f9.m4a",
  "Ali points to the labels.": "/audio/basic-english/79a8af97b1469b171dee.m4a",
  "\"You drew a sun,\" he says.": "/audio/basic-english/6669eb0d99c0e46e1cbb.m4a",
  "Emma checks the word too.": "/audio/basic-english/ee66650ce51518b857e9.m4a",
  "\"Yes, this one says BEANS!\"": "/audio/basic-english/12b15efaf415191ae2dd.m4a",
  "Before leaving, Emma puts her name on the label as well.": "/audio/basic-english/7b953ae0e9ff03ec37e2.m4a",
  "\"Now it tells me the plant and the person,\" she says.": "/audio/basic-english/b107ba67025c50fd689d.m4a",
  "Ali adds his name to his label too.": "/audio/basic-english/f6c8eb6a203129585644.m4a",
