  "In a dream, Tom finds a little shop on the moon.": "/audio/basic-english/ac241cb780874e3153e6.m4a",
  "The shop has silver hats, blue clouds and tiny stars in glass jars.": "/audio/basic-english/3b381991b8a534519efc.m4a",
  "\"You may choose one thing,\" says the shopkeeper.": "/audio/basic-english/99f48d9cb409f6fe2b36.m4a",
  "Tom looks at a silver hat.": "/audio/basic-english/9e63ea42e1beb6d88379.m4a",
  "It is beautiful, but he does not choose it.": "/audio/basic-english/cb81bc02350e1ba5978a.m4a",
  "He thinks of his little sister, Lily.": "/audio/basic-english/7186e26c97b31109ec6a.m4a",
  "She is afraid when her room is dark.": "/audio/basic-english/61edd8facb1159f4f62b.m4a",
  "Tom chooses a tiny star for her.": "/audio/basic-english/3bdfc2bf7a4e4566da3a.m4a",
  "\"A kind choice,\" says the shopkeeper.": "/audio/basic-english/e1c6e55696f2d11a36d1.m4a",
  "\"But stars belong in the sky.": "/audio/basic-english/a7232dcfeb375294b2d7.m4a",
  "Try making a light together when you wake up.\"": "/audio/basic-english/bfe41080f3ac09db06e1.m4a",
  "Tom wakes up.": "/audio/basic-english/279235a1c8f0831465bd.m4a",
  "After breakfast, he draws stars on paper.": "/audio/basic-english/c3e66db288b2cf400ac9.m4a",
  "Mum helps the children decorate the outside of a battery lamp with the paper stars.": "/audio/basic-english/90edfefe1603642e18af.m4a",
  "That night, Lily turns on the lamp.": "/audio/basic-english/caf3b3ec18b7e9aa3958.m4a",
  "\"It is our little moon shop,\" she says.": "/audio/basic-english/be36e7ade7f7b739b6f8.m4a",
  "Tom smiles.": "/audio/basic-english/95963907a4e6f4dd6528.m4a",
  "The dream is over, but the kind idea stays.": "/audio/basic-english/3d23b5a76fc825dc9e8c.m4a",
